          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "When you came back for the bag earlier, you didn't have your keys with you, right? You knocked and rang the doorbell.",
